Question: vTv Therapeutics terminated its phase 2 Elevage trial of azeliragon (NCT03980730). What reason did it give the registry, what did it tell investors, and do the two match?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: none

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Analyze the registry history and current metadata for trial NCT03980730 (Elevage study of azeliragon, sponsored by vTv Therapeutics). Verify the overall status, completion dates, the exact text and category for why the trial was stopped, when results were first posted to ClinicalTrials.gov, and whether they were submitted late.", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT03980730 (Elevage study of azeliragon sponsored by vTv Therapeutics) has an overall status of TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT03980730"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live and in the snapshot."}, {"claim": "The exact text for why the trial was stopped is \"for business reasons\", categorized under business/strategic.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT03980730"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Keyword method classification."}, {"claim": "Trial dates: start date was 2019-06-27, primary completion date was 2020-12-01, and completion date was 2021-01-29, with an enrollment of 43 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT03980730"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Consistent across snapshot and live records."}, {"claim": "Results were first posted to ClinicalTrials.gov on 2022-01-21.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT03980730"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Results are posted."}, {"claim": "The results due date was 2021-12-01, and results were submitted late by 51 days.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT03980730"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Days late calculated based on primary completion date plus 365 days versus results first post date."}, {"claim": "Azeliragon has no approved applications listed in Drugs@FDA.", "evidence_ids": ["fda:none:azeliragon"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Checked via get_fda_approvals."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Investigate SEC filings (such as 8-K, 10-Q, or 10-K) for vTv Therapeutics Inc. (CIK 0001641489) from late 2020 through early 2021. Focus on the announcements made on or around December 15, 2020, and February 24, 2021, regarding the Phase 2 Elevage study of azeliragon (NCT03980730). Document what the company told investors about why enrollment was concluded, why development was discontinued, and whether the trial met its objectives.", "findings": [{"claim": "On November 5, 2020, vTv Therapeutics announced its decision to conclude enrollment in the Elevage Study at the end of September 2020 and anticipated announcing topline results in December 2020.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0001564590-20-051429"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Form 8-K filing snippet explicitly names the trial and CEO statement."}, {"claim": "On February 24, 2021, vTv Therapeutics reported that on December 15, 2020, it announced that the Phase 2 Elevage Study of azeliragon did not meet its primary objective, leading to the discontinuation of the development of azeliragon for Alzheimer's disease.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0001564590-21-008154"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Form 8-K filing snippet explicitly names the trial, date of announcement, lack of primary objective achievement, and discontinuation reason (efficacy/did not meet primary objective)."}, {"claim": "The company noted it was evaluating potential alternative indications for azeliragon in partnership with other interested parties.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0001564590-21-008154"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Form 8-K filing snippet."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Search PubMed and Europe PMC for any peer-reviewed publications associated with trial NCT03980730 (azeliragon in patients with mild Alzheimer's disease and impaired glucose tolerance, Elevage study). Determine if the results of this trial were ever published in a journal, or if reporting was restricted to the registry and press releases.", "findings": [{"claim": "No direct peer-reviewed publication reporting the results of trial NCT03980730 (Elevage study) was found in PubMed or Europe PMC.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:40207764", "pubmed:40462159", "pubmed:40686923", "pubmed:41090735", "pubmed:42009954"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "All five articles returned by find_publications were Europe PMC text-mining mentions of azeliragon or related terms, and none reported the trial's results."}, {"claim": "Article PMID 40207764 mentions azeliragon or related terms in text-mining but focuses on 'Conventional and Emerging Drug Targeting Sites in Alzheimer's Disease and the Role of Translational Informatics in its Diagnosis and Management.'", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:40207764"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Europe PMC mention only; does not report trial NCT03980730 results."}, {"claim": "Article PMID 40462159 mentions azeliragon or related terms in text-mining but focuses on 'Revisiting the therapeutic landscape of tauopathies: assessing the current pipeline and clinical trials.'", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:40462159"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Europe PMC mention only; does not report trial NCT03980730 results."}, {"claim": "Article PMID 40686923 mentions azeliragon or related terms in text-mining but focuses on 'Extracellular Matrix Signaling Cues: Biological Functions, Diseases, and Therapeutic Targets.'", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:40686923"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Europe PMC mention only; does not report trial NCT03980730 results."}, {"claim": "Article PMID 41090735 mentions azeliragon or related terms in text-mining but focuses on 'Tau-Targeted Therapeutic Strategies: Mechanistic Targets, Clinical Pipelines, and Analysis of Failures.'", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:41090735"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Europe PMC mention only; does not report trial NCT03980730 results."}, {"claim": "Article PMID 42009954 mentions azeliragon in the context of ovarian aging and RAGE signaling ('small-molecule inhibitors (Azeliragon and FPS-ZM1)').", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:42009954"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Europe PMC mention only; does not report trial NCT03980730 results."}], "gaps": []}]

